      "idRef": {
        "id": "9cc9d6f94f7856fb5b6203a5"
      },
      "index": 0,
      "text": "Well done {COMPANY.CompanyName}, you have secured the spaceport and we have successfully prevented the [[DM.Factions[faction_HarbingersOfDoom],Harbingers]] from establishing a beachhead there, but overall the situation is not good. \n\nWe lost the [[DM.BaseDescriptionDefs[LoreEspinosaRefitYards],Espinosa Refit Yards]] due to a coordinated landing while their infiltrators attacked it from the inside. The [[DM.Factions[faction_TortugaPirates],Kittens]] kept their 'Mechs at bay initially but she was forced to withdraw once we lost control of the complex.",
