    {
      "idRef": {
        "id": "9c187605c1c583d837653d9f"
      },
      "index": 2,
      "text": "And their naval blockade is about to extend to the planet, since the <i>[[DM.BaseDescriptionDefs[LoreJumpShipOrionsBelt],Orion's Belt]]</i> is maneuvering to position itself in Coromodir IV's orbit in a matter of days once their main fleet arrives. \n\nOnce that happens, they can secure any landing zone and we'll be facing a lot more than lances.",
      "branches": [
        {
          "responseText": "",
          "conditions": null,
          "actions": null,
          "nextNodeIndex": 3,
          "hideIfUnavailable": true,
          "onlyOnce": false,
          "idRef": {
            "id": "9cb644ac7c274ecb7a5d2fad"
          },
          "inputBypass": false,
          "auxiliaryLink": false,
          "comment": ""
        }
      ],
      "nodeType": 1,
      "truthValue": false,
      "autoFollowBranchDelay": 1,
      "inputMaxLength": 0,
      "sourceTopicRef": null,
      "subjectTopicRefs": [],
      "sourceInSceneRef": null,
      "sourceWithTagInScene": "",
      "override_speaker": null,
      "speaker_override_id": "598cd3a06230355c18000067",
      "actions": null,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "idRef": {
        "id": "9c4af88ab842bdf47a218790"
      },
      "index": 3,
      "text": "It will be checkmate once their [[DM.BaseDescriptionDefs[LoreWarShip],WarShip]] arrives.\n\nThey will have us trapped on [[DM.BaseDescriptionDefs[LoreCoromodir],Coromodir IV]], without any way to get reinforcements or to break through their blockade.",
      "branches": [
        {
          "responseText": "",
          "conditions": null,
          "actions": null,
          "nextNodeIndex": 4,
          "hideIfUnavailable": true,
          "onlyOnce": false,
          "idRef": {
            "id": "9c0c4bd6c28684af447b485b"
          },
          "inputBypass": false,
          "auxiliaryLink": false,
          "comment": ""
        }
      ],
      "nodeType": 1,
      "truthValue": false,
      "autoFollowBranchDelay": 1,
      "inputMaxLength": 0,
      "sourceTopicRef": null,
      "subjectTopicRefs": [],
      "sourceInSceneRef": null,
      "sourceWithTagInScene": "",
      "override_speaker": null,
      "speaker_override_id": "598cd3f36230355c1800006a",
      "actions": null,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "idRef": {
        "id": "9c11991c06bef4b80dcf5d49"
      },
      "index": 4,
      "text": "Their ship as a 'WarShip' in reality it is nothing more than a heavily armed ancient JumpShip, like the [[DM.BaseDescriptionDefs[LoreJollyRoger],jolly rogers]] such as the Kittens' <i>[[DM.BaseDescriptionDefs[LoreBadKitty],Bad Kitty]]</i>.\n\nRegardless, the <i>Orion's Belt</i> with its DropShips and AeroFighters will achieve air superiority over the planet unless there's a way to oppose them.",
      "branches": [
        {
          "responseText": "",
          "conditions": null,
          "actions": null,
          "nextNodeIndex": 5,
          "hideIfUnavailable": true,
          "onlyOnce": false,
          "idRef": {
            "id": "9cd393b7ab2f013d197a44ab"
          },
          "inputBypass": false,
          "auxiliaryLink": false,
          "comment": ""
        }
      ],
      "nodeType": 1,
      "truthValue": false,
      "autoFollowBranchDelay": 1,
      "inputMaxLength": 0,
      "sourceTopicRef": null,
      "subjectTopicRefs": [],
      "sourceInSceneRef": null,
      "sourceWithTagInScene": "",
      "override_speaker": null,
      "speaker_override_id": "598cd3a06230355c18000067",
      "actions": null,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "idRef": {
        "id": "9ca8c42cdea427dd0091b65e"
      },
      "index": 5,
      "text": "Besides the loss of the Refit Yards, Kamea's status as MIA is causing morale issues throughout the Aurigan defenders.\n\nAlso, Precentor Rodriguez has contacted us, he has been hiding since Harbinger infiltrators occupied [[DM.Factions[faction_ComStar],ComStar]]'s HPG facility.",
      "branches": [
        {
          "responseText": "",
          "conditions": null,
          "actions": null,
          "nextNodeIndex": 6,
          "hideIfUnavailable": true,
          "onlyOnce": false,
          "idRef": {
            "id": "9c6e11100468616f7aa25443"
          },
          "inputBypass": false,
          "auxiliaryLink": false,
          "comment": ""
        }
      ],
      "nodeType": 1,
      "truthValue": false,
      "autoFollowBranchDelay": 1,
      "inputMaxLength": 0,
      "sourceTopicRef": null,
      "subjectTopicRefs": [],
      "sourceInSceneRef": null,
      "sourceWithTagInScene": "",
      "override_speaker": null,
      "speaker_override_id": "59b97f45623035ac140054ca",
      "actions": null,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "idRef": {
        "id": "9c57a6f9fb1c6cee3c587669"
      },
      "index": 6,
      "text": "Wait, didn't the [[DM.BaseDescriptionDefs[LoreComStarRobbie],robbies]] report it being destroyed and us placed under ComStar [[DM.BaseDescriptionDefs[LoreComStarInterdiction],interdiction]] because we were considered a party to its destruction?\n\nTheir [[DM.BaseDescriptionDefs[LoreHPG],HPG]] is still operating?",
      "branches": [
        {
          "responseText": "",
          "conditions": null,
          "actions": null,
          "nextNodeIndex": 7,
          "hideIfUnavailable": true,
          "onlyOnce": false,
