      "actions": null,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "idRef": {
        "id": "9c4dc6f0f7da139cdc0472fa"
      },
      "index": 8,
      "text": "The Harbingers did the same previously at [[DM.BaseDescriptionDefs[LoreHellespont],Hellespont]], back where we first encountered the Kittens in the [[DM.BaseDescriptionDefs[LoreHyadesRim],Hyades Rim]].\n\nThey overran the local ComStar facility until Captain Murray recaptured it for herself.",
      "branches": [
        {
          "responseText": "",
          "conditions": null,
          "actions": null,
          "nextNodeIndex": 9,
          "hideIfUnavailable": true,
          "onlyOnce": false,
          "idRef": {
            "id": "9cb0216a2e57af20dc34bb58"
          },
          "inputBypass": false,
          "auxiliaryLink": false,
          "comment": ""
        }
      ],
      "nodeType": 1,
      "truthValue": false,
      "autoFollowBranchDelay": 1,
      "inputMaxLength": 0,
      "sourceTopicRef": null,
      "subjectTopicRefs": [],
      "sourceInSceneRef": null,
      "sourceWithTagInScene": "",
      "override_speaker": null,
      "speaker_override_id": "598cd3f36230355c1800006a",
      "actions": null,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "idRef": {
        "id": "9cf74a922ec4b08eabf7b1e0"
      },
      "index": 9,
      "text": "Back then the Harbingers were using the [[DM.BaseDescriptionDefs[LoreHPG],HPG]] antenna but they didn't kill any of its personnel.\n\nThat was entirely Captain Murray's and her [[DM.Factions[faction_TortugaPirates],Kittens]] when she was attempting to use the HPG transmitter for her own proposes.",
      "branches": [
        {
          "responseText": "",
          "conditions": null,
          "actions": null,
          "nextNodeIndex": 10,
          "hideIfUnavailable": true,
          "onlyOnce": false,
          "idRef": {
            "id": "9cc474b75e66b552de56db1c"
          },
          "inputBypass": false,
          "auxiliaryLink": false,
          "comment": ""
        }
      ],
      "nodeType": 1,
      "truthValue": false,
      "autoFollowBranchDelay": 1,
      "inputMaxLength": 0,
      "sourceTopicRef": null,
      "subjectTopicRefs": [],
      "sourceInSceneRef": null,
      "sourceWithTagInScene": "",
      "override_speaker": null,
      "speaker_override_id": "59b98a97623035ac140056c6",
      "actions": null,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "idRef": {
        "id": "9c5298b01370e07ff110482c"
      },
      "index": 10,
      "text": "Even a lowly [[DM.BaseDescriptionDefs[LoreComStarAdept],adept]] can be troublesome if they report you back to the authorities, <i>da</i>?\n\nBetter to leave no witnesses behind and to make sure no one listens to your messages, like [[DM.BaseDescriptionDefs[LoreJeromeBlake],Blake]]'s eunuchs do all the time.",
      "branches": [
        {
          "responseText": "You kept other witnesses alive including us.",
          "conditions": null,
          "actions": null,
          "nextNodeIndex": 11,
          "hideIfUnavailable": true,
          "onlyOnce": false,
          "idRef": {
            "id": "9c69059ae5f4fed99ae111bb"
          },
          "inputBypass": false,
          "auxiliaryLink": false,
          "comment": ""
        }
      ],
      "nodeType": 1,
      "truthValue": false,
      "autoFollowBranchDelay": 1,
      "inputMaxLength": 0,
      "sourceTopicRef": null,
      "subjectTopicRefs": [],
      "sourceInSceneRef": {
        "id": "TortugaPirateLeaderDefault"
      },
      "sourceWithTagInScene": "",
      "override_speaker": null,
      "speaker_override_id": "",
