      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "idRef": {
        "id": "9c4247db4a30d6c5c3e22513"
      },
      "index": 11,
      "text": "You were useful, or at least some of you were, {COMMANDER.Callsign}.\n\nAnd you kept your side of the bargain as a mercenary while ComStar wouldn't be so... cooperative.",
      "branches": [
        {
          "responseText": "",
          "conditions": null,
          "actions": null,
          "nextNodeIndex": 12,
          "hideIfUnavailable": true,
          "onlyOnce": false,
          "idRef": {
            "id": "9c55021d039e153a539b3b0d"
          },
          "inputBypass": false,
          "auxiliaryLink": false,
          "comment": ""
        }
      ],
      "nodeType": 1,
      "truthValue": false,
      "autoFollowBranchDelay": 1,
      "inputMaxLength": 0,
      "sourceTopicRef": null,
      "subjectTopicRefs": [],
      "sourceInSceneRef": {
        "id": "TortugaPirateLeaderDefault"
      },
      "sourceWithTagInScene": "",
      "override_speaker": null,
      "speaker_override_id": "",
      "actions": null,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "idRef": {
        "id": "9c5041617c62f1ea7592347c"
      },
      "index": 12,
      "text": "The Harbingers breaching ComStar's neutrality isn't a surprise but we need to help them retake their facility and clear our name and ask for help from Terra.\n\nBut the priority is to send a lance to rescue Lady Arano, otherwise our morale and defense might crack without her to lead us in battle.",
      "branches": [
        {
          "responseText": "<color=#85DBF6FF>[Story Decision: Rescue Kamea first.]</color> Agreed, Lady Arano is still out there.",
          "conditions": null,
          "actions": null,
          "nextNodeIndex": 13,
          "hideIfUnavailable": true,
          "onlyOnce": false,
          "idRef": {
            "id": "9c630c33af0234b9f7a9e6b3"
          },
          "inputBypass": false,
          "auxiliaryLink": false,
          "comment": ""
        },
        {
          "responseText": "<color=#85DBF6FF>[Story Decision: Retake HPG facility.]</color> We will assist the Precentor and ComStar.",
          "conditions": null,
          "actions": null,
          "nextNodeIndex": 14,
          "hideIfUnavailable": true,
          "onlyOnce": false,
          "idRef": {
            "id": "9c09b80dd6596602ee4ecaef"
          },
          "inputBypass": false,
          "auxiliaryLink": false,
          "comment": ""
        }
      ],
